/**
 * The Bandhan Project (tbp;) - Central CMS Data Store & State Manager
 * ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
 * Content model (three layers, lowest to highest priority):
 *
 *   1. DEFAULT_SITE_DATA  - the built-in fallback shipped in this file.
 *   2. content.js         - the PUBLISHED content for every visitor.
 *                           Generated by the Admin panel ("Publish" / Export)
 *                           and committed as assets/js/content.js.
 *   3. localStorage draft - unsaved edits made in THIS browser via the Admin
 *                           panel. Never seen by other visitors until published.
 *
 * Public visitors never write localStorage, so they always see layer 2 (or 1).
 */

